                <head ana="#head_untitled-missing-head-in-printed-volume">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Headquarters Department of the
                                East,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">New York,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1865-04-21"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >April</hi> 21, 1865</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I certify on honor that the facts stated in the foregoing report were derived
                    from the examination of Pratt and Green, except the fact reported of their
                    concealment on board the Corsica, which was reported to me by revenue officer
                    James S. Chalker.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WM. H. LUDLOW, <hi rendition="#italic">Acting Aide-de-Camp and Acting
                            Inspector General, Department of the East.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
